  },
  {
    "line": 133,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "QUOTED_STRING",
    "text": "\"Measles primary series is complete.\""
  },
  {
    "line": 134,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "REQUEST",
    "text": "request"
  },
  {
    "line": 134,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "ACTIVITY_TYPE",
    "text": "CPGCommunicationRequest"
  },
  {
    "line": 135,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "WITH",
    "text": "with"
  },
  {
    "line": 135,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "BACKTICK_STRING",
    "text": "`Measles primary series is complete. Two measles primary series doses were administered. Check if a measles supplementary dose is appropriate for the client.`"
  },
  {
    "line": 136,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "BECAUSE",
    "text": "because"
  },
  {
    "line": 136,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "BACKTICK_STRING",
    "text": "`An additional dose of MCV should be administered to HIV-infected children receiving HAART following immune reconstitution. If CD4+ T lymphocyte counts are monitored, an additional dose of MCV should be administered when immune reconstitution has been achieved, e.g. when the CD4+ T lymphocyte count reaches 20–25%. Where CD4+ T lymphocyte monitoring is not available, children should receive an additional dose of MCV 6–12 months after initiation of HAART.`"
  },
  {
    "line": 136,
    "column": 470,
    "type": "DOT",
    "text": "."
  },
  {
    "line": 138,
    "column": 0,
    "type": "ACTIVITY",
    "text": "activity"
  },
  {
    "line": 138,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "QUOTED_STRING",
    "text": "\"Client Age Less Than 9 Months\""
  },
  {
    "line": 139,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "REQUEST",
    "text": "request"
  },
  {
    "line": 139,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "ACTIVITY_TYPE",
    "text": "CPGCommunicationRequest"
  },
  {
    "line": 140,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "WITH",
    "text": "with"
  },
  {
    "line": 140,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "BACKTICK_STRING",
    "text": "`Should not vaccinate client as client's age is less than 9 months. Check for any vaccines due, and inform the caregiver of when to come back for MCV1.`"
  },
  {
    "line": 140,
    "column": 161,
    "type": "DOT",
    "text": "."
  },
  {
    "line": 142,
    "column": 0,
    "type": "ACTIVITY",
    "text": "activity"
  },
  {
    "line": 142,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "QUOTED_STRING",
    "text": "\"Measles primary series is complete\""
  },
  {
    "line": 143,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "REQUEST",
    "text": "request"
  },
  {
    "line": 143,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "ACTIVITY_TYPE",
    "text": "CPGCommunicationRequest"
  },
  {
    "line": 144,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "WITH",
    "text": "with"
  },
  {
    "line": 144,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "BACKTICK_STRING",
    "text": "`Measles primary series is complete. Two measles primary series doses were administered. Check if a measles supplementary dose is appropriate for the client.`"
  },
  {
    "line": 145,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "BECAUSE",
    "text": "because"
  },
  {
    "line": 145,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "BACKTICK_STRING",
    "text": "`An additional dose of MCV should be administered to HIV-infected children receiving HAART following immune reconstitution. If CD4+ T lymphocyte counts are monitored, an additional dose of MCV should be administered when immune reconstitution has been achieved, e.g. when the CD4+ T lymphocyte count reaches 20–25%. Where CD4+ T lymphocyte monitoring is not available, children should receive an additional dose of MCV 6–12 months after initiation of HAART.`"
  },
  {
    "line": 145,
    "column": 470,
    "type": "DOT",
    "text": "."
  },
  {
    "line": 147,
    "column": 0,
    "type": "ACTIVITY",
    "text": "activity"
  },
  {
    "line": 147,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "QUOTED_STRING",
    "text": "\"Last Live Vaccine Administered Within 4 Weeks_4\""
  },
  {
    "line": 148,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "REQUEST",
    "text": "request"
  },
  {
    "line": 148,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "ACTIVITY_TYPE",
    "text": "CPGCommunicationRequest"
  },
  {
    "line": 149,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "WITH",
    "text": "with"
  },
  {
    "line": 149,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "BACKTICK_STRING",
    "text": "`Should not vaccinate client for measles supplementary dose as live vaccine was administered in the last 4 weeks. Check for any vaccines due, and inform the caregiver of when to come back for supplementary dose.`"
  },
  {
    "line": 149,
    "column": 221,
    "type": "DOT",
    "text": "."
  },
  {
    "line": 151,
    "column": 0,
    "type": "ACTIVITY",
    "text": "activity"
  },
  {
    "line": 151,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "QUOTED_STRING",
    "text": "\"Supplementary Dose Administered\""
  },
  {
    "line": 152,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "REQUEST",
    "text": "request"
  },
  {
    "line": 152,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "ACTIVITY_TYPE",
    "text": "CPGCommunicationRequest"
  },
  {
    "line": 153,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "WITH",
    "text": "with"
  },
  {
    "line": 153,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "BACKTICK_STRING",
    "text": "`Measles immunization schedule is complete. Measles supplementary dose was administered.`"
  },
  {
    "line": 153,
    "column": 98,
    "type": "DOT",
    "text": "."
  },
  {
    "line": 155,
    "column": 0,
    "type": "ACTIVITY",
    "text": "activity"
  },
  {
    "line": 155,
    "column": 9,
    "type": "QUOTED_STRING",
    "text": "\"Check Contraindication for Measles Immunization\""
  },
  {
    "line": 156,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "REQUEST",
    "text": "request"
  },
  {
    "line": 156,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "ACTIVITY_TYPE",
    "text": "CPGMedicationRequest"
  },
  {
    "line": 156,
    "column": 33,
    "type": "WITH",
    "text": "with"
  },
  {
    "line": 156,
    "column": 38,
    "type": "QUOTED_STRING",
    "text": "\"Measles vaccines\""
  },
  {
    "line": 157,
    "column": 4,
    "type": "BECAUSE",
    "text": "because"
  },
  {
    "line": 157,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "BACKTICK_STRING",
    "text": "`While vaccines are universally recommended, some clients may have contraindications to particular vaccines.<br/>Additional contraindications may be included in WHO position papers for the vaccine - Measles vaccines: WHO position paper (April 2017).`"
  },
  {
    "line": 157,
    "column": 262,
    "type": "DOT",
    "text": "."
  },
  {
